### Create order – basic example
POST http://localhost:3000/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "order-001",
  "value": 100
}

###

### Create order – higher value
POST http://localhost:3000/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "order-002",
  "value": 450.75
}

###

### Create order – edge case (zero value)
POST http://localhost:3000/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "order-003",
  "value": 0
}

###

### Create order – large payload
POST http://localhost:3000/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "order-004",
  "value": 9999.99,
  "currency": "BRL",
  "customerId": "cust-123"
}
